From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000001 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: IFX <ifx@infineon.com>
Date: Wed, 22 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] IFX: Align includes with tf-psa-crypto v1.1.0

tf-psa-crypto v1.1.0 renamed mbedtls/build_info.h to
tf-psa-crypto/build_info.h and moved legacy low-level headers
(ecp.h, aes.h, ...) under mbedtls/private/.

Because this acceleration library may also be consumed by projects
that still build against the classic mbedtls header layout, the
include paths are selected at build time instead of being replaced:
when IFX_TF_PSA_CRYPTO_INCLUDES is defined the new
tf-psa-crypto v1.1.0 locations are used, otherwise the original
mbedtls locations are kept. TF-M defines this macro for the
ifx_mbedtls_acceleration target.

Update only the headers/sources that are actually reached by the
MXCRYPTO transparent-driver build used by TF-M. The mbedtls_alt_*
sources that still reference removed classic headers are not
compiled in this build, so they are left untouched.

ifx_cryptolite_config.h's default configuration branch (used whenever
no IFX_PSA_CRYPTOLITE_USER_CONFIG_FILE is supplied, e.g. builds with
IFX_CRYPTOSUITE_ENABLED=OFF) needs the same treatment: it is reached
by every TF-PSA-Crypto TU (e.g. crypto_service_p256-m) via
psa/crypto_struct.h -> crypto_driver_contexts_primitives.h, not just
by ifx_mbedtls_acceleration's own sources.

---
 mbedtls_MXCRYPTOLITE/ecdsa_alt_mxcryptolite.c             |  6 +++++-
 mbedtls_MXCRYPTOLITE/sha256_alt_mxcryptolite.c            |  6 +++++-
 mbedtls_MXCRYPTOLITE/trng_alt_mxcryptolite.c              | 20 ++++++++++++++----
 .../mbedtls_psa_MXCryptolite/ifx_cryptolite_common.h      |  6 +++++-
 .../mbedtls_psa_MXCryptolite/ifx_cryptolite_config.h      |  6 +++++-
 .../ifx_cryptolite_transparent_functions.h                |  6 +++++-
 6 files changed, 41 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

